Cell["\<\
Due to classify being relatively inaccurate, I tried using a neural network \
instead. I used a template given to me by the TA Nicol\[OGrave]. I only used \
the first 10,000 sequences in the OEIS data because using the full data set \
would take at least 24 hours to run.\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules->{},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.898177635732926*^9, 3.898177637401672*^9}, 
   3.898178767569248*^9, {3.898197938586452*^9, 3.89819798404812*^9}, {
