Cell["\<\
I would like to thank my mentor Eli Morton for helping me complete this \
project. I would also thank Nicol\[OGrave] for helping me with neural \
networks.  I would also like to thank all the Wolfram Summer Research Staff \
for everything I have learned and opportunities I got from the Wolfram Summer \
Research Program. Also a huge thanks to Anika Patel and Zoya Brahimzadeh for \
being awesome and supporting me!\
\>", "Text",
